{"4059920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Magus Relics: the Majimono", "steam_appid": 4059920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet forest deafens a choir of secrets. Nothing of value remains here for those who seek in the dark. The youngster opens the book, and a dim light appears. It is dim indeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted open world with multiple traversal methods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layered player mechanics that interact with each other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple secret mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diegetic puzzles of many kinds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 collectables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 pages of meaningful narrative integrated with the gameplay</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet forest deafens a choir of secrets. Nothing of value remains here for those who seek in the dark. The youngster opens the book, and a dim light appears. It is dim indeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted open world with multiple traversal methods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layered player mechanics that interact with each other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple secret mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diegetic puzzles of many kinds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 collectables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 pages of meaningful narrative integrated with the gameplay</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Explore, find the light, unveil the truth. Dive into the secrets of Naivia's history, unearthing the voices once lost, fac